---
description: Do not return protobuf types from GraphQL resolvers
globs: "**/Schema/Types/**/*.cs"
alwaysApply: false
---

# No protobuf in GraphQL

Map contract responses to GraphQL models before returning.

```csharp
var response = await grpcClient.GetItemAsync(
    new GetItemRequest { Id = id },
    cancellationToken: cancellationToken);

return mapper.Map(response.Item);
```
